      "constraints": [
        "Require reviewer decisions and explicit confirmed apply; never delete automatically from fuzzy confidence or treat matches as participant identity authority.",
        "Keep participant values unchanged when saving review decisions; recheck schema, row and decision hashes and reviewer identity under a document lock before one atomic batchUpdate with audit.",
