        "Use only synthetic or redacted fixtures and authorized workbook copies for UAT; never push or apply to the production workbook as a test.",
        "Keep matching on the explicitly owned backend and sidebar assets local; no third-party matching API or participant data in repository. The old no-fetch Privacy sentence is stale relative to canonical backend introduction, BACKEND.md and the allowed relay in noExternalCalls.test.ts.",
